      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Design idea: Instead of having one big slider that could be hard to accurately let go on the right spot, have two sliders.\n\nSlider from 0-900, going up in 100 increments\n\n●ーーーーー●\n\nSlider going from 5-95, going up in 5 increments\n\n●ーーーーー●\n\nSo, for example, if I want 325MB as my cutoff, I drop the first slider on \"300\"  and the second slider at \"25\".",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
